  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/R28CPFc.png\" alt=\"Мел\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Отмечайте свой путь через огромный мир Minecraft®!</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">•</h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">Мел позволяет рисовать метки для облегчения навигации в пещерах или строениях.</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qx2fgdp.png\" alt=\"Мелки\" width=\"1000\" height=\"273\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/f43BLYS.png\" alt=\"Знаки\" width=\"1000\" height=\"225\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YfuLEeh.png\" alt=\"Светящиеся\" width=\"1000\" height=\"212\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FjhcKIR.png\" alt=\"Коробка с мелом\" width=\"1000\" height=\"273\"></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Yb5gsGmDugM?wmode=transparent\" width=\"1000\" height=\"561\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Это мод для <strong>Forge/NeoForge</strong>.</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Играете на&nbsp;<strong>Fabric</strong>? Вот порт:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chalk-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chalk (Fabric) от </a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/dafuqsy/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">DaFuqsy.</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FzHKGDW2et\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/discord.png\" alt=\"Сервер Discord\" width=\"550\" height=\"88\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Нравится мод? Ваша поддержка позволит мне продолжать работу над этим и другими модами!</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"550\" height=\"108\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253d4VPMCBCLZVUEA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/paypal.png\" alt=\"PayPal\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Посмотрите мои другие моды:</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exposure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/main.png\" alt=\"Exposure\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/envelope\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/envelope/main.png\" alt=\"Envelope\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sooty-chimneys\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PHaFgV2.png\" alt=\"Sooty Chimneys\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wares\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tpmC8km.png\" alt=\"Wares\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/monobank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1Le5yWV.png\" alt=\"Monobank\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/thief/main.png\" alt=\"Thief\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/salt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NhbmXO8.png\" alt=\"Salt\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scholar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/scholar/main-512.png\" alt=\"Scholar\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horseman\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/horseman/main.png\" alt=\"Horseman\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>",
